      "id": "pane-height",
      "content": {
        "content_kind": "text",
        "payload": {
          "title": "Drag a pane's bottom edge",
          "body": "Drag the bottom edge of a pane to make it shorter or taller; it snaps to the same thirds and halves as the edges between panes. The arrow keys move it to the next size, and Home lets it fill again."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "add-beside",
      "content": {
        "content_kind": "text",
        "payload": {
          "title": "Add a pane beside or below",
          "body": "Open this menu on any pane. Split in half shares its room; Add a pane beside or below opens a new pane at its own size while every pane keeps its size, and the panes scroll. Choose that size in Account, Panes."
